            ; ---- the strip between the tiles and the RESET card ----
            ; 40px, which is what the page has left once the behaviour tiles end
            ; and the RESET card takes its place against HubFtrY(). The animated
            ; circuit doodle that used to fill the left of it is gone - 13 line
            ; segments, 6 ellipses and 3 sparkle pens redrawn every frame for
