            ; telling you something.
            pvy := HL.setp + dy2
            ; ---- GALLERY ----
            ; The rotation is shared by the gate hero, the update-log card and
            ; the minimised pill, so it is one setting rather than three. It
            ; needs a grid to edit, which will not fit in a 40px band, so what
            ; lives here is the count and the way in; the manager itself is the
            ; gallery card, which is already a grid of exactly these pictures.
            ; ---- layout: two self-contained groups, one per edge ----
            ; This band carries two unrelated readouts and one button, and the
            ; button belonged to the FIRST readout while sitting past the second
            ; - so it read as four loose fragments with 80px of dead space in the
            ; middle, and nothing said which label the button answered to.
            ;
            ; Regrouped so each half is whole and anchored:
            ;   [swatch][LIVE PREVIEW / values] ....... [GALLERY / count][MANAGE]
            ; The visual leads its own caption on the left, the caption leads its
            ; own control on the right, and the gap between them is now the only
            ; empty space in the row rather than one of three. Both edges are
            ; pinned, so the middle reads as breathing room instead of a hole.
            ;
            ; MANAGE does not move: its hit zone in HubZone is written against
            ; this same x0 + HL.ctw - 116, and the two have to agree.
            ;
            ; Everything is centred on pvy + 20, the swatch's own centre. The
            ; captions used to start at pvy + 2 against a 40px swatch, so the
            ; text sat four pixels high of everything beside it.
